#: build/admin.js:3
msgid "Block"
msgstr ""

#: build/admin.js:3
msgid "In the block editor, add the “Text to Speech Player” block where the player should appear. Its sidebar lets you change the layout and whether the title is read. A post that contains the block does not also get the automatic player."
msgstr ""

#: build/admin.js:3
msgid "Shortcode"
msgstr ""

#: build/admin.js:3
msgid "Add the shortcode to any post, page or widget area that supports shortcodes. The player reads the article that contains it."
msgstr ""

#: build/admin.js:3
msgid "Attribute"
msgstr ""

#: build/admin.js:3
msgid "Values"
msgstr ""

#: build/admin.js:3
msgid "Invalid values are ignored and the global settings are used instead."
msgstr ""

#: build/admin.js:3
msgid "Browsers and voices"
msgstr ""

#: build/admin.js:3
msgid "Speech uses the Web Speech API built into the browser. Voices, languages and quality depend on the visitor’s operating system and browser."
msgstr ""

#: build/admin.js:3
msgid "Some in-app browsers and privacy-focused browsers have no speech support. The player then explains that instead of showing controls that do nothing."
msgstr ""

#: build/admin.js:3
msgid "Some browsers stop speaking when the tab is in the background or the screen locks."
msgstr ""

#: build/admin.js:3
msgid "Pausing remembers the last word the browser reported. Voices that do not report word positions resume from the start of the current sentence."
msgstr ""

#: build/admin.js:3
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr ""

#: build/admin.js:3
msgid "No player on a post: check that its content type is selected under General, and that the post has not opted out in the editor sidebar."
msgstr ""

#: build/admin.js:3
msgid "“There is no text to read here”: the theme may place the content outside the area the player reads. Add the block or shortcode inside the content instead."
msgstr ""

#: build/admin.js:3
msgid "No sound: confirm the device volume and that the browser has a voice for the reading language."
msgstr ""

#: build/admin.js:3
msgid "Privacy"
msgstr ""

#: build/admin.js:3
msgid "The plugin makes no external requests and collects no analytics. Text is spoken by the browser on the visitor’s device; note that some browser vendors provide online voices that process text on their own servers. Visitors’ voice and speed choices are stored only in their browser’s local storage."
msgstr ""

